Contagion is a 2011 American medical thriller
film directed by Steven Soderbergh.

11
00:43:11,111 --> 00:43:17,111
Its ensemble cast includes Matt Damon, Laurence Fishburne, Jude Law,
Marion Cotillard, Kate Winslet, and Gwyneth Paltrow.

12
00:47:06,666 --> 00:47:12,666
The plot concerns the spread of a highly contagious virus transmitted through respiratory droplets and fomites, attempts by medical researchers and public health officials to
identify and contain the disease, the loss of social order as the virus turns into a worldwide pandemic, and the introduction of a vaccine to halt its spread.

13
00:51:02,222 --> 00:51:08,222
To follow several interacting plot lines, the film makes use of the multi-narrative
"hyperlink cinema" style, popularized in several of Soderbergh's films.

14
00:54:57,777 --> 00:55:03,777
The film was inspired by real-life outbreaks such as the
2002–2004 SARS outbreak and the 2009 flu pandemic.

